s="et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone et-pb-icon"></span></span></div> <div class="et_pb_blurb_container"> <h4 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>EMAIL US</span></h4> <div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>zrariden@spinedoctors.md</p></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_2 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular" > <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_0 et_pb_equal_columns"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_2_5 et_pb_column_2 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_0"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="800" height="800" src="https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Dr.-Snavely.webp" alt="Dr. Snavely" title="Dr. Snavely" srcset="https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Dr.-Snavely.webp 800w, https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Dr.-Snavely-480x480.webp 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 800px, 100vw" class="wp-image-915" /></span> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_5 et_pb_column_3 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner">Dr. Snavely was one of the first surgeons in the country to use the 7D Surgical image-guided navigation system. 7D is now routinely utilized for safer and more efficient spinal surgery while reducing radiation exposure.</div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_3 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular" > <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_1 et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters1"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_2_5 et_pb_column_4 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_1"> <a href="https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/The-Spine-Scoliosis-Center-81.png" class="et_pb_lightbox_image" title=""><span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1080" height="1080" src="https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/The-Spine-Scoliosis-Center-81.png" alt="" title="The Spine &amp; Scoliosis Center-8(1)" srcset="https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/The-Spine-Scoliosis-Center-81.png 1080w, https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/The-Spine-Scoliosis-Center-81-980x980.png 980w, https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/The-Spine-Scoliosis-Center-81-480x480.png 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 1080px, 100vw" class="wp-image-661" /></span></a> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_5 et_pb_column_5 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_11 vide_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_content"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_container"> <h4 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>25-year-old patient with intractable back pain and progressive deformity underwent a successful scoliosis surgery performed by Dr. Geoffrey Stewart in January 2023. Curve was 90% corrected and improved. Patient is 2 inches taller, 2 weeks after surgery.</span></h4> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_4 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular" > <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_2 et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters4"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_6 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_2"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1080" height="1080" src="https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/new-pic.jpg" alt="live free" title="new pic" srcset="https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/new-pic.jpg 1080w, https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/new-pic-980x980.jpg 980w, https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/new-pic-480x480.jpg 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 1080px, 100vw" class="wp-image-624" /></span> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_7 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 pa-heading-line-right et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h4>ABOUT THE PRACTICE</h4></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h3>We&#8217;ve Been Helping People Find Pain Relief <em>Since 1990.</em></h3> <p>&nbsp;</p></div> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p>Studies suggest that back pain affects approximately 90% of adults at some point in their lives and about 67% of adults experience neck pain. These two ailments are among the most common reasons for physician visits and are major causes of disability, missed workdays, and high health care costs. With those painful hurdles in mind, The Spine and Scoliosis Center is giving Central Floridians practical, high-quality solutions through revolutionary care.</p></div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_3 et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters1"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_8 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_3 et_pb_image_sticky"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="512" height="512" src="https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/left-quotes-sign.svg" alt="" title="left-quotes-sign" class="wp-image-12" /></span> </div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_6 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h3>Since our doors opened, we have been committed to providing personalized care that improves our patients&#8217; quality of life. We&#8217;ve been very successful at accomplishing that.</h3></div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_5 et_section_regular" > <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_4 et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters1"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_2_5 et_pb_column_9 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_divider_1 et_pb_space et_pb_divider_hidden"><div class="et_pb_divider_internal"></div></div> </div><div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_5 et_pb_column_10 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_12 vide_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_content"> <div class="et_pb_blurb_container"> <h4 class="et_pb_module_header"><span>The Spine and Scoliosis Center is a top orthopaedic clinic connecting Florida patients with innovative, personalized care, with locations in Orlando, Clermont, Winter Haven, and Davenport. If you are seeking a spine specialist, call us to schedule an appointment with our expert medical team today.</span></h4> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_6 et_pb_section_parallax et_pb_with_background et_section_regular" > <span class="et_parallax_bg_wrap"><span class="et_parallax_bg" style="background-image: url(https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/leg-rehabilitation-close-up.jpg);" ></span></span> <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_5"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_11 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_4"> <span class="et_pb_image_wrap "><img loading="lazy" de