/03/keeps-adults-from-getting-help-400x250.webp" alt="The Scoliosis Myth That Keeps Adults From Getting Help" class="" srcset="https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/keeps-adults-from-getting-help.webp 479w, https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/keeps-adults-from-getting-help-400x250.webp 480w " sizes="(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw " width="400" height="250" /></a></div> <h2 class="entry-title"> <a href="https://spinedoctors.md/article/the-scoliosis-myth-that-keeps-adults-from-getting-help/">The Scoliosis Myth That Keeps Adults From Getting Help</a> </h2> <p class="post-meta"><a href="https://spinedoctors.md/category/article/" rel="tag">Article</a></p><div class="post-content"><div class="post-content-inner et_multi_view_hidden"><p>Scoliosis affects almost 7 million people in the U.S. Scoliosis is a condition where the spine is abnormally curved, often resulting in physical discomfort and aesthetic issues. The two main types of scoliosis are Adolescent Idiopathic Scoliosis and Adult Degenerative...</p> </div><a href="https://spinedoctors.md/article/the-scoliosis-myth-that-keeps-adults-from-getting-help/" class="more-link">read more</a></div> </article> <article id="post-939" class="et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_blog_item_0_1 post-939 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-article"> <div class="et_pb_image_container"><a href="https://spinedoctors.md/article/traveling-with-scoliosis-tips-to-stay-comfortable-and-protect-your-spine/" class="entry-featured-image-url"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/tips-to-stay-comfortable-and-protect-your-spine-400x250.webp" alt="Traveling with Scoliosis: Tips to Stay Comfortable and Protect Your Spine" class="" srcset="https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/tips-to-stay-comfortable-and-protect-your-spine.webp 479w, https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/tips-to-stay-comfortable-and-protect-your-spine-400x250.webp 480w " sizes="(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw " width="400" height="250" /></a></div> <h2 class="entry-title"> <a href="https://spinedoctors.md/article/traveling-with-scoliosis-tips-to-stay-comfortable-and-protect-your-spine/">Traveling with Scoliosis: Tips to Stay Comfortable and Protect Your Spine</a> </h2> <p class="post-meta"><a href="https://spinedoctors.md/category/article/" rel="tag">Article</a></p><div class="post-content"><div class="post-content-inner et_multi_view_hidden"><p>Traveling often involves sitting in a car, bus, train, or airplane for prolonged periods of time in cramped positions. For people with scoliosis, the discomfort of travel can be multiplied. However, you shouldn’t let the thought of an aching back after long hours in...</p> </div><a href="https://spinedoctors.md/article/traveling-with-scoliosis-tips-to-stay-comfortable-and-protect-your-spine/" class="more-link">read more</a></div> </article> <article id="post-930" class="et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_blog_item_0_2 post-930 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-article"> <div class="et_pb_image_container"><a href="https://spinedoctors.md/article/scoliosis-in-adults-new-treatment-options-and-solutions-in-2026/" class="entry-featured-image-url"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/adults-new-treatment-options-and-solutions-in-2026-400x250.webp" alt="Scoliosis in Adults: New Treatment Options and Solutions in 2026" class="" srcset="https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/adults-new-treatment-options-and-solutions-in-2026.webp 479w, https://spinedoctors.md/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/adults-new-treatment-options-and-solutions-in-2026-400x250.webp 480w " sizes="(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw " width="400" height="250" /></a></div> <h2 class="entry-title"> <a href="https://spinedoctors.md/article/scoliosis-in-adults-new-treatment-options-and-solutions-in-2026/">Scoliosis in Adults: New Treatment Options and Solutions in 2026</a> </h2> <p class="post-meta"><a href="https://spinedoctors.md/category/article/" rel="tag">Article</a></p><div class="post-content"><div class="post-content-inner et_multi_view_hidden"><p>Scoliosis is a spinal condition involving the abnormal curvature of the spine. For the millions of people all over the world affected by scoliosis, spinal fusion surgery has traditionally been the gold-standard, go-to treatment. Fortunately, recent years have brought...</p> </div><a href="https://spinedoctors.md/article/scoliosis-in-adults-new-treatment-options-and-solutions-in-2026/" class="more-link">read more</a></div> </article> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div><div id="testimonials" class="et_pb_section et_pb_section_10 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular" > <div class="et_pb_row et_pb_row_10"> <div class="et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_18 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child"> <div class="et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_14 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light"> <div class="et_pb_text_inner"><pre class="ti-widget"><template id="trustindex-google-widget-html"><div class=" ti-widget ti-goog ti-disable-animation ti-show-rating-text ti-review-text-mode-readmore ti-text-align-left" data-no-translation="true" data-time-locale="%d %s ago|today|day|days|week|weeks|month|months|year|years" data-plugin-version="13.2.7" data-layout-id="44" data-layout-category="slider" data-set-id="ligth-border-3d-large" data-pid="" data-language="en" data-close-locale="Close" data-css-version="2" data-reply-by-locale="Owner's reply" data-only-rating-locale="This user only left a rating." data-pager-autoplay-timeout="6"> <div class="ti-widget-container ti-col-2"> <div class="ti-reviews-container"> <div class="ti-controls"> <div class="ti-next" aria-label="Next review" role="button" tabindex="0"></div> <div class="ti-prev" aria-label="Previous review" role="button" tabindex="0"></div> </d